Effects in forge-energylab-fx.bundle come from Unity Asset Store packs and are shipped only inside this built bundle; the packs' own files are not
redistributed. Pack, licence as recorded by the effect library, effects used:

Electricity- Assets for VFX 04 [1.0]
  Unity Asset Store EULA（只能随构建发布，不能分发原素材）
  紫色大型命中火花, 紫色电击命中星爆

Explosions 3D [1.0]
  Unity Asset Store EULA（只能随构建发布，不能分发原素材）
  灰黑小型爆炸

Free Quick Effects Vol 1
  Standard Unity Asset Store EULA (may ship inside built mod bundles; raw assets must not be redistributed or committed)
  橙色枪口火焰, 青色聚能内爆

Master MagicFX Bundle 1.0
  Unity Asset Store EULA（只能随构建发布，不能分发原素材）
  紫色法术枪口闪光, 蓝色剑气命中, 蓝色子弹拖尾, 蓝色枪口闪光, 蓝色激光束, 蓝色电弧命中闪光, 蓝色闪电电弧光束, 蓝色闪电能量球, 蓝色魔法爆炸, 金色剑击命中火花, 青蓝能量弹

